On Fri, Mar 24, 2006 at 11:05:35PM +0100, alpha-linux at gmx.net wrote:
> 
> i just installed AC2.0 on a AlphaStation500/400.
> i can't get Xorg to work with the Permedia2 (Elsa Gloria Synergy).
> 
> with AC1.0 it was working ...
> 
> what do i need to do ?

Add a BusID option to the Device Section of the xorg.conf file.

For example, from /sbin/lspci I see that my ELSA is in slot 7, so:

	BusID    "PCI:0:7:0"

And then it works... :-)

Good luck.

